id: terranubis/f3-demo-2020
title: F3 Demo 2020 (Dutch North Sea)
summary: >-
  The F3 block 3D seismic survey with four wells, horizons and interpretations, packaged
  as an OpendTect demonstration project by dGB Earth Sciences.
publisher: {name: dGB Earth Sciences (TerraNubis), url: https://terranubis.com, country: NL}
origin:
  url: https://terranubis.com/datainfo/F3-Demo-2020
  access: registration
licence:
  name: Creative Commons 3.0 (the page links the BY-SA 3.0 deed)
  spdx: CC-BY-SA-3.0
  url: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
  redistribution: allowed
  attribution: required
  share_alike: true
kinds: [seismic-3d, wellbore-logs, wellbore-headers, horizons]
region: {country: NL, basin: Dutch North Sea (F3 block), bbox: [4.6, 54.75, 5.05, 54.95], crs: "EPSG:23031"}
size: {stated: "about 1.3 GB"}
listed_by: [seg-wiki, publisher]
known_issues:
  - "Publisher replaced F3-Demo-2020 with F3 Demo 2023 on 12 June 2023; /datainfo/F3-Demo-2020 now serves the 2023 page (7.6 GB, 4.5 GB download), whose licence label links the BY-SA 3.0 deed. Licence fields corrected from the earlier BY-SA 4.0 entry to what the page states."
period:
  start: "1987"
  end: "1987"
  stated: "URL now serves the F3 Demo 2023 page; General: \"Acquisition: 1987\" (same F3 survey)."
